1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
People ask me, "How we doing?"

2
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,940
I tell 'em, "Well, I woke up, so no complaints"

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:10,100
And I ask 'em, "So tell me, how we doing?"

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,420
And here's the secret

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:16,500
Their mind goes looking for something good to tell me

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,820
And it finds it

7
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,880
Every single time
